4" class="r-dvn2wv"><div data-rid="51afb36b-9c7c-4eb2-9072-bf14d50d267c" class="r-1mmqjdv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="b2d4dcfa-6e48-43c4-8959-c2ffa32ed4dd" class="r-1thmyi2" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="2e5c8b96-1613-4e66-98a1-53b02ef82e7b" class="r-pr3qpj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1439adc7-764b-4ea7-bab5-770514b9aef5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R7jbp1r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-2hsbmb"><div data-rid="d5f564a5-bf54-424a-8240-3424da872afa" class="r-dyzlh6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is Attaboy?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b5c6fa71-07d7-40e9-92c1-0953f713e834" class="r-yo93a4" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-dzlguz" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R7jbp1r2:"><div data-rid="8b3d58dd-dd97-45f2-aae7-4574b4b60706" class="r-1d36s0o"><div data-rid="bd6cb3fd-0154-4301-af62-1ce65bfaec28" class="r-2uzi98 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Attaboy is a men's health and performance brand built to cut through the clutter of wellness hype and give guys a smarter, simpler way to feel and perform better. We combine clinically backed ingredients, transparent formulas, and real-world utility into products that actually make a difference, without the fluff. It’s wellness designed for the doers, thinkers, and builders who want to feel dialed in every damn day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="fccfa7b3-8069-4c6e-a61f-ab16a6cc0be2" class="r-17b2f26" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="17b9fc89-4cc7-4434-9f89-d297f2b695a8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rbjbp1r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ejk5uc"><div data-rid="18a39974-cf19-45e6-b7f6-dbdece693c56" class="r-1ssupl7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">What's Actually In Every Damn Day?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="a0c84dbd-3795-4395-8c58-c2c46ddae6f3" class="r-17oipop" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-ts6qqo" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rbjbp1r2:"><div data-rid="752aaca3-282f-4b78-81e3-9ef791e495ab" class="r-4joeu4"><div data-rid="f68d0c71-5f68-4c0b-a81b-2374d1b01c6a" class="r-1flrlhr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Every Damn Day is made with 14 research-backed ingredients, each one included for a reason, and dosed to deliver real results. No proprietary blends, no under dosed fluff. You’ll find performance-focused compounds like Creatine Monohydrate, L-Citrulline, Alpha-GPC, and Glycine, plus key electrolytes and metabolic support, all working together to fuel energy, focus, strength, hydration, and recovery in one scoop.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4f563060-4749-4698-94a4-f996149adcf9" class="r-1q2bwxb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7159d069-3e10-4e53-b47e-7adccd9ff5ac" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rfjbp1r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-7311ye"><div data-rid="b4bde946-d3a7-4be0-82de-2f7c2d398bfc" class="r-1bflc73 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">What does Every Damn Day Replace?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="490be818-954b-4f0d-9153-d60d40ba8b7b" class="r-gjs94j" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-18yrefk" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rfjbp1r2:"><div data-rid="72e87a5d-05ed-4a01-b4ad-061796338bf9" class="r-qqlqrr"><div data-rid="487e1b98-a790-4453-98f9-65e0b2c7f80e" class="r-1y1habz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Every Damn Day replaces the cluttered stack of powders, pills, and half-finished routines crowding your cabinet. It delivers the core benefits of a pre-workout, hydration mix, recovery formula, and cognitive support, without the need for caffeine, sugar, or synthetic junk. One scoop gives you everything you actually need to perform, recover, and feel better, without the overwhelm or expense of managing 5+ products.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="bd22098d-3aeb-4a2a-83f1-b24203ae6d7e" class="r-rr9f4b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="749b0262-3965-4cad-9f7c-2b5963f8fcb5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rjjbp1r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-64akr1"><div data-rid="9520760e-2355-44f9-83db-a2a04d9645bb" class="r-j53x2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">How do I take Every Damn Day?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="52dc0159-ca1c-4a00-acdb-f86efcf4c341" class="r-21l6qv" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor"